  "notes": [
    "Paths are relative to the corpus root, examples. Two copies of one example: dynamic_codegen loads ../../protos/route_guide.proto with @grpc/proto-loader (new routeguide.RouteGuide(...), addService(routeguide.RouteGuide.service, ...)); static_codegen requires protoc output (new services.RouteGuideClient(...), addService(services.RouteGuideService, ...)).",
    "Both clients dial localhost:50051 and either server listens there, so the two copies are one client service and one server service; each service lists both files.",
    "client is the line of client.<rpc>(...); runGetFeature calls getFeature twice. server is the handler function's declaration; server_alternatives is its entry in the addService map.",
    "static_codegen/route_guide_grpc_pb.js and route_guide_pb.js are protoc output: don't-care. Every other example directory is don't-care: not labelled here."
  ],
